# Sudoku Game- NINE N DINE ENIGMA WILDMIND SWEETMIND FLYMIND

I built this Sudoku game to challenge myself a bit and also because I'm obsessed with Sudoku.
- not sure if I want this game to be scary or cutesy
- ideas so far
pincinc theme
fairy and wild theme mushrooms etc

