## Running game
kjjmnb 
### What you need first

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) installed on your computer

### Installing it

I clone the project and install what it needs:

```powershell
git clone https://github.com/OyinAlamu/sudoku-game.git
cd sudoku-game
npm install
```

### Starting it

```powershell
npm run dev
```


